# BazaarPrinting CRM — UI Design System v1.0

## Themes: Light (Navy & Gold) · Dark (Charcoal & Orange)

### CSS Token Reference
Always use these variables. **Never hardcode hex values in components.**

| Token | Light | Dark |
|---|---|---|
| `--color-bg` | `#F8F7F4` | `#18181B` |
| `--color-surface` | `#FFFFFF` | `#27272A` |
| `--color-topbar` | `#1B2B4B` | `#27272A` |
| `--color-accent` | `#E8C97A` | `#F97316` |
| `--color-accent-dark` | `#C9A84C` | `#FB923C` |
| `--color-text-primary` | `#333333` | `#F4F4F5` |
| `--color-text-muted` | `#888888` | `#71717A` |
| `--color-border` | `#E5E7EB` | `#3F3F46` |
| `--color-badge-bg` | `#EAF0FB` | `#2D1F0E` |
| `--color-badge-text` | `#1B2B4B` | `#FB923C` |
| `--color-row-alt` | `#F8F7F4` | `#27272A` |
| `--color-row-hover` | `#EAF0FB` | `#27272A` |
| `--color-btn-primary-bg` | `#E8C97A` | `#F97316` |
| `--color-btn-primary-text` | `#1B2B4B` | `#FFFFFF` |
| `--color-btn-verify-bg` | `#1B2B4B` | `#F97316` |
| `--color-btn-verify-text` | `#E8C97A` | `#FFFFFF` |
