Semantic colors (not tokenized — use directly):
- Danger: `#DC2626` / dark `#EF4444`
- Success: `#16A34A` / dark `#22C55E`
- Warning: `#D97706` / dark `#F59E0B`

## Typography
- **Font: Inter** (Google Fonts via `next/font/google`). Fallback: `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif`
- Max font-weight: **600**. Never use 700+.
- Table headers: `11px / 500 / uppercase / letter-spacing: 0.06em` in `--color-text-muted`
- Page title (h1): `20px / 600` in `--color-text-primary`
- Button text: `13px / 500`

## Layout
- **Left collapsible sidebar** for navigation. Background: `var(--color-topbar)` (navy light / dark gray dark).
- Expanded width: `224px` (`w-56`). Collapsed width: `56px` (`w-14`). Collapse state persisted in `localStorage` key `bazaar-sidebar-collapsed`.
- Brand name at sidebar top: `BAZAARPRINTING` in `var(--color-accent)`, `letter-spacing: 0.05em`.
- Active nav item: `background: var(--color-accent)`, `color: var(--color-btn-primary-text)`. Inactive: `rgba(255,255,255,0.65)` on hover `rgba(255,255,255,0.9)`.
- Bottom of sidebar: Dark mode toggle, Sign out, Collapse button — all using `rgba(255,255,255,0.55)` text.
- Page content: `max-width: 1280px`, centered, `padding: 24px` (desktop) / `16px` (mobile).
- Spacing scale: multiples of 4px only (`4 / 8 / 12 / 16 / 20 / 24 / 32px`).

## Border Radius Tokens
- `4px` — badges, chips, status pills
- `6px` — buttons, inputs, small cards
- `10px` — cards, modals, dropdowns
- `16px` — large panels
- `9999px` — toggle switches, avatars, round pills

## Component Rules

### Topbar
- Logo: `"BAZAARPRINTING"` — `font-weight 500–600`, `color: var(--color-accent)`, `letter-spacing: 0.05em`
- Dark mode: add `border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border)`
- Theme toggle button on the right

### Tab Navigation
- Active: `color: var(--color-tab-active)`, `border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-tab-underline)`, `font-weight: 500`
- Inactive: `color: var(--color-tab-inactive)`, `font-weight: 400`
- Padding: `10px 14px`

### Buttons
- All: `border-radius: 6px`, `padding: 6px 14px`, `font-size: 13px`, `font-weight: 500`
- Primary CTA: `bg: var(--color-btn-primary-bg)`, `color: var(--color-btn-primary-text)`
- Verify (table row): `bg: var(--color-btn-verify-bg)`, `color: var(--color-btn-verify-text)`
- Danger: `bg: #DC2626` / `#EF4444`, `color: white`
- Hover: lighten 8% (light) / brighten 10% (dark). Active: `scale(0.97)`

### Status Pills
- Not Defined: `bg #F2F2F0 / text #999` · dark: `bg #27272A / text #52525B / border #3F3F46`
- High: `bg #FEF2F2 / text #DC2626` · dark: `bg #450A0A / text #EF4444`
- Medium: `bg #FFFBEB / text #D97706` · dark: `bg #431407 / text #F59E0B`
- Low: `bg #F0FDF4 / text #16A34A` · dark: `bg #052E16 / text #22C55E`

### Table Rows
- Light: odd `#FFFFFF`, even `#F8F7F4`, hover `#EAF0FB`
- Dark: all rows `#1C1C1F`, hover `#27272A`
- Min row height: `52px`. Sticky header at `top: 100px`

### Skeleton / Loading
- Never full-page spinner — always table skeleton
- Light shimmer: `#E5E7EB → #F3F4F6`. Dark: `#27272A → #3F3F46`

### Toast
- Bottom-right, `16px` from edges, auto-dismiss 4s
- Success: left border `4px solid #16A34A`. Error: `4px solid #DC2626`

### Modal
- Overlay: `rgba(0,0,0,0.45)`. `border-radius: 12px`, `padding: 24px`, `max-width: 520px`
- Bg: `#FFFFFF` light / `#27272A` dark

## Dark Mode
- Toggle class `dark` on `<html>`. LocalStorage key: **`bazaar-theme`**
- Read on load before first render to avoid flash

## Do's & Don'ts
- ✅ 100% token-based colors — zero hardcoded hex in components
- ✅ Flat colors only — no gradients, no drop shadows on topbar/tab bar
- ✅ Gold/orange ONLY for primary actions and active indicators
- ✅ 52px+ row heights for comfortable click targets
- ✅ Inter font throughout
- ✅ Skeleton loaders while data fetches
- ❌ No fixed topbar (brand + nav lives in the sidebar)
- ❌ No gradients, no topbar/tab-bar shadows
- ❌ No font-weight 700+
- ❌ No emoji in production UI — use Lucide SVG icons
- ❌ Never more than 2 accent colors in the same view
